{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/a31cbee9168e78c895667809d2b3104f.avif?t=1752763933\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.poster.webp?t=1752763933\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.webp?t=1752763933\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a relaxing yet mind-bending journey through thousands of uniquely designed mazes. From classic square puzzles to complex circular, triangular, and even hexagonal labyrinths\u2014experience a truly diverse and enchanting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path through combinations of maze shapes, sizes, and game modes. Whether you're looking for a calming puzzle break or a strategic challenge, there's something here for every mood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Creative Level Design: Conquer 4 maze types\u2014square, circular, triangular, and hexagonal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 5 Unique Challenges: Classic, Portal, Token, Limited Moves, Timed and Dark Mazes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Power-ups: 3 helpful powers to help you find your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Satisfying puzzles: Enjoy a peaceful session with small mazes, or test your skills on advanced ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique Shapes: Explore mazes shaped like fish, guitars, trees, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Beautiful Design: Vivid colors and soothing music create a visually and emotionally engaging experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock constellations of puzzles, discover secret paths, and lose yourself in the ultimate maze adventure.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3795750?t=1752763933","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/649fdee4108dc9fd274946c0d7c8c14d4b1118a7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1752763933","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/3718ee006c2938c61a367552aaf55dccf9ce1b82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1752763933","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/3718ee006c2938c61a367552aaf55dccf9ce1b82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1752763933","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/a31cbee9168e78c895667809d2b3104f.avif?t=1752763933\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.poster.webp?t=1752763933\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/extras/c1ba13b250d5ae29db3356934735ebc7.webp?t=1752763933\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Embark on a relaxing yet mind-bending journey through thousands of uniquely designed mazes. From classic square puzzles to complex circular, triangular, and even hexagonal labyrinths\u2014experience a truly diverse and enchanting experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose your path through combinations of maze shapes, sizes, and game modes. Whether you're looking for a calming puzzle break or a strategic challenge, there's something here for every mood.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Creative Level Design: Conquer 4 maze types\u2014square, circular, triangular, and hexagonal</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- 5 Unique Challenges: Classic, Portal, Token, Limited Moves, Timed and Dark Mazes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Power-ups: 3 helpful powers to help you find your way</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Satisfying puzzles: Enjoy a peaceful session with small mazes, or test your skills on advanced ones</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Unique Shapes: Explore mazes shaped like fish, guitars, trees, and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">- Beautiful Design: Vivid colors and soothing music create a visually and emotionally engaging experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock constellations of puzzles, discover secret paths, and lose yourself in the ultimate maze adventure.</p>","developers":["Infinity Games, Lda"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3795750/3bb87cd3b5e288fc4fcc8827db1eaaf96469b39c/header.jpg?t=1752763933","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 QubicGames S.A.<br />\r\n\u00a9 2020 Infinity Games, Lda","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257161890,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161890/movie480.mp4?t=1752763931","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257161890/movie_max.mp4?t=1752763931"},"name":"Maze: Path of Light - Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/s